Scope and excluded assets

The MIT License above covers the source code of SOTTR Explorer (the crates/
directory, apps/desktop/ application code, scripts and documentation authored
for this project).

It does NOT cover, and grants no rights in, the following, which remain under
their own terms:

1. Map basemap images under data/map/ (data/map/basemaps.json and
   data/map/maps/*.webp). These images were created and published by the
   author vi7ual on spriters-resource (submissions 502127, 502132, 502133)
   for personal projects and non-commercial work. Copyright remains with the
   original rights holders; commercial use requires separate permission.

2. Game data facts under data/catalog/ and data/metadata/ (collectible names,
   region names, coordinates, counters). These describe Shadow of the Tomb
   Raider, whose copyrights and trademarks belong to Square Enix and Crystal
   Dynamics. Their inclusion is a factual reference, not a relicensing of any
   game asset.

3. Third-party components listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the inventories
   under licenses/. Each component remains under its own license.

Shadow of the Tomb Raider and related marks are trademarks of their respective
owners. This project is an unofficial, read-only fan tool and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Square Enix or Crystal Dynamics.
